config BR2_PACKAGE_RAOFFLINEPROXY
	bool "raofflineproxy"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	help
	  Local RetroAchievements proxy (misantronic): caches each
	  game's achievement data while online and queues casual
	  unlocks earned offline, sending them once the server is
	  reachable again. nuubos-emud runs it for the casual sessions
	  of a user with Offline Achievements on (GitHub #18). Only the
	  Linux service (Python) is installed.

	  https://github.com/misantronic/RAOfflineProxy
